{"id":"one-eyed-pass","name":"One-Eyed Pass","type":"location","aliases":[],"description":"A mountain pass where the Akroan squad is ambushed by a minotaur horde.","pages":2,"first_seen":"2014-02-26","last_seen":"2014-03-05","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e4","era":null,"summary":"The squad finds nine beheaded, butchered Akroans in the pass, including Captain Eumalos, and Xanthos identifies minotaur tracks.","participants":["leandros","diocles","xanthos","captain-eumalos","minotaurs"],"location":"one-eyed-pass","importance":"major","page":"stories/walls-akros-2014-02-26","order":432,"story_date":"2014-02-26","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":69,"quote":"There were nine Akroans lying on the ground, their bodies already bloating in the heat.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=There%20were%20nine%20Akroans,bloating%20in%20the%20heat.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=There%20were%20nine%20Akroans,bloating%20in%20the%20heat.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e5","era":null,