26#:~:text=Mnesos%20fell%20to%20the,seeping%20from%20his%20stomach.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Mnesos%20fell%20to%20the,seeping%20from%20his%20stomach.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e9","era":null,"summary":"The minotaur leader joins the fight, severs Nikasios's leg and hurls Haemon against the canyon wall with a sickening crack.","participants":["nikasios","haemon","minotaurs"],"location":"one-eyed-pass","importance":"major","page":"stories/walls-akros-2014-02-26","order":432,"story_date":"2014-02-26","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":105,"quote":"Nikasios lurched to one side, but the minotaur struck his leg, severing it.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Nikasios%20lurched%20to%20one,his%20leg%2C%20severing%20it.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Nikasios%20lurched%20to%20one,his%20leg%2C%20severing%20it.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e10","era":null,"summary":"Kyrillos rams his sword into the minotaur leader's gut, is slammed down and stomped, and the leader is beheaded by Pallas and Leandros, its body falling on K